Description: experimental NonRAID storage plugin for Proxmox VE 9
 Integrates one node-local NonRAID array with the Proxmox VE 9 storage API.
 The package includes a fail-open, compatibility-gated web UI integration;
 activation remains disabled until the backend and real-node gates pass.
